  "detailed_description": "The scheme &quot;National Mission For Sustainable Agriculture-Parmparagat Krishi Vikas Yojana (NMSA-PKVY)&quot; is a Centrally Sponsored Scheme that aims to promote traditional and sustainable organic farming practices among farmers by providing financial support and infrastructure assistance. The scheme extends financial assistance for a maximum of 2 hectares per farmer for organic farming inputs, infrastructure development for on-farm organic input production, and related activities.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant should be a farmer.\n  - The applicant should be a resident of Gujarat.\n\n<br>\n\n",
